                                                "sense_id": "7c0a72b4-58ed-31ae-a6c2-05beba215759",
                                                "text": "‘Sir, I have seen all the visibilities of Paris, and around it; but to have formed an acquaintance with the people there, would have required more time than I could stay.’"
